Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.14,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.42,0:00:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我清楚自己想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但以你的生活方式 我无法如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't have it … not how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正试着淡忘你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to get over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能打着爱对方的旗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 'cause you love someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就肆意妄为地纠缠对方 搅乱对方的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean you should stick around and screw up their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚你这是在抛家弃子 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're walking out on your family, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对龙你有什么研究嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,维斯艾克博士 中古研究系 西蒙菲莎大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Visyak. Medieval studies, S.F.U.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby Singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次见他时帮我带句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him something for me next time you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是 直接踢他的蛋蛋得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, just kick him in the jewels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉斐尔 - 明天你要臣服于我 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Raphael… - Tomorrow you kneel, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想游说我在天堂发起内战么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you proposing that I start a civil war in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding! Ding! Ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴尔萨泽 - 我当然乐意帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balthazar. - Of course I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动战争所需的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the amount of power that it would take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}To mount a war …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我说我知道如何拥有最强的能量呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if I said I knew how to go nuclear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.76,0:00:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你勾结了克劳力试图找到炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and crowley have been going after purgatory together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了温家兄弟 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just kill the winchesters. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就只好亲自出马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你胆敢碰他们一根毫毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you touch a hair on their heads,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.58,0:00:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就毁掉我们的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tear it all down … our arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.08,0:00:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就如同我另一个弟弟一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are like a brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果我阻止你做什么的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if I'm asking you not to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得相信我 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to trust me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就将不昔一切地阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'll have to do what I have to do to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.95,0:01:08.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:13.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1937年3月15日）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（普维敦斯 罗得岛）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:36.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（完）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.67,0:02:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.72,0:02:45.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（猎黑行者 作者 H·P·洛夫克拉夫特 1937年3月15日）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 至少你尽力了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what? At least you tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 一点用都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a fat lot of good it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他为什么还要出现呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he even come, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔的日记屁用没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Samuel's journals are pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.50,0:03:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我的无礼 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm sorry, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰毕戴·坎贝尔可没提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jebediah Campbell has squat to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么阻止小卡打开炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how to stop Cass from cracking purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 并不是我们手上这些资料没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it's not about the journals we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.96,0:03:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是因为我们没有找对正主\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the one we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.21,0:03:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.07,0:03:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的搭档小卡那天晚上可不是来认错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our pal Cass didn't stop in last night just to mend fences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.80,0:03:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 偷走了些东西 - 啥东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stole something. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩西·坎贝尔的一本日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The journal of one Moishe Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩西\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Moishe"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约州的坎贝尔家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the New York Campbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.61,0:03:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得把它找回来 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so we got to get it back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是直接看我之前弄的复印本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or just read the copy I had already made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位好 我是偏执狂鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Glad to meet you. Bobby singer, paranoid bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像找到条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I zeroed in on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啥发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:04:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,去跟霍华德·飞利浦聊了聊三月十日的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Went to talk to Howard Phillips about the events of March 10th."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.33,0:04:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是1937年3月10日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's March 10, 1937.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解 不过这菲利普斯是谁来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so, who's this Phillips guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲利普斯可不是他的姓 他是洛夫克萊夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phillips ain't his last name. It's Lovecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.95,0:04:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 H·P·洛夫克萊夫特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait … H.P. Lovecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很有名还是怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I supposed to know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.04,0:04:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖小说作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horror writer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:18.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,《疯狂山脉》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"At the mountains of madness, "
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.10,0:04:19.57,Title,0,0,0,0,,《克苏鲁的呼唤》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The call of cthulhu."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前光忙着和女人翻云覆雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm … I was too busy having sex with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.02,0:04:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之 在他的小说里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyhow, there's one notion that comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次次地提到同一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and over again in his stories …
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.54,0:04:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是打开别个空间之门 让可怕的东西穿行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Namely, opening doors to other dimensions and letting scary crap through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你觉得洛夫克萊夫特对炼狱有所了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you're saying you think Lovecraft knew something about purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能肯定的就是 摩西去拜访过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, Moishe paid him a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.27,0:05:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放 放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just … just let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.93,0:05:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人闯进家里 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's men in the house. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了马特 抓了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed Matt. They got Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.31,0:05:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 我能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming. I hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是什么 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they? - I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到他们的眼睛了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see their eyes? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 牙齿呢 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teeth? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这很重要 本 我必须知道 - 迪恩 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is important, Ben. I need to know. - Dean, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 你现在在哪儿 - 在我房间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben, where are you now? - In my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.53,0:05:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,能接近你妈的衣柜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you get to your mom's closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有我留下的散弹枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left a shotgun in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 迪恩 我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Dean, what do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Ben, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去窗边 然后跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your window… and jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 断几根骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?! - Any bones you break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起他们要对你做的事可好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't compare to what they're gonna do to you, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须跳出去 - 好吧 我这就跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've got to jump. - Okay, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救出你们母子俩的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you and your mom, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在吗 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me, Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,想聊聊吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.94,0:06:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.95,0:06:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久了 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long is being, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.81,0:06:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我上次假死算起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since my so-called demise, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 放他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, let them go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I swear …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在我身上开各种洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll rip me a cornucopia of orifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先跟你说说现在的情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to the bit where I tell you how this goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.92,0:06:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我的菜盘子里搅和太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chocolate's been in my peanut butter for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 总这么风趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dean. Ever the wit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手上有你的 什么来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got your … what are they? …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,前女性朋友和一个小大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ex-ladyfriend and not-kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.39,0:07:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你别再管我的闲事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm keeping them until I'm satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就不放人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you've backed the hell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 再不放人就别怪我不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you … last chance to let 'em go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你威胁人的时候真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're adorable when you get all threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我不会伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry … I won't hurt them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是你和绿巨人让开道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provided you and Jolly green stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.89,0:07:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了么 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it? Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,么么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说只要我们老实呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said Lisa and Ben keep breathing…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.26,0:07:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎和本就能活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as we sit on our thumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得小卡知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Cass knows about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,得假设他知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to assume he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.47,0:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以告诉你我们不要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what we're not gonna do …
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,干坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去找他们 - 我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going after 'em. - I'm coming with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和鲍比继续查洛夫克萊夫特这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bobby stay on the Lovecraft thing, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡已经先我们好几步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is already way ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.01,0:08:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你傻了 我不可能让你一人去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be nuts if you think I'm gonna let you do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比可以自己查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby can take care of the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 兄弟们 - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, guys. - Bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事非同小可 我们不能现在放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a big ball. Okay? We can't drop it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你俩要怎么找到莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how are you two gonna find Lisa and Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.55,0:08:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看我像男仆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like a manservant to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像吗 那就别召唤我了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? No? Then quit ringing for me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.11,0:08:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事很重要 巴尔萨泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important, Balthazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚正在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was drinking a '75 dom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女歌手的肚脐上吸75年的廊酒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of a soprano's navel when you called.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小爷我早知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you've been scooped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass already told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小卡有没有告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, did Cass tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和克劳力变成好基友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he is Crowley's butt buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个臭屁的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}you smug little dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 君子交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Handshake deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,平分炼狱中的所有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go halfsies on all the souls of purgatory …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉你这个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fill you in on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的 当然说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yes, yes. Yes, of course he did. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, of course. I … I …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.88,0:09:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就别装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can read it all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力和小卡抓走了两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley and Cass took two people.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说很重要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.89,0:09:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我要关心这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I care about this because…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为没准有那么一丝的正义感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because maybe there is a shred of decency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏在你这臭皮囊下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underneath this … this snarky crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.70,0:09:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're innocent people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.94,0:09:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求你了 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm asking for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.59,0:09:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,操你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.69,0:09:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 还是找小卡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean, let's just call Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他并不知道 - 我们不能叫小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he doesn't know anything about… - We are not calling Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是 迪恩 - 我们不找小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, but, Dean… - we're not calling cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.11,0:09:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.65,0:09:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 恐怖小说 挺三俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, uh, horror … lowbrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说没什么内含 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put us in the ghetto, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是洛夫克拉夫特这人很有文采\N{\fnArial\fs30}But H.P. Lovecraft … this guy is literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该被编入教科书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he … he should be taught in schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该和狄更斯与丁·雷·昆士齐名\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up there with Dickens and…Dean R. Koontz.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和我作品中呈现出的观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's … that's definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直如出一辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The angle I'm taking with my piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你可以 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. You can … please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.91,0:10:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你收集了大量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I hear you have a large collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫克拉夫特私人信件\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Lovecraft's private letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.37,0:10:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上最多\N{\fnArial\fs30}World's largest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很受妹子青睐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be catnip to the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在进行一段长期的网恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a long-term online relationship, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问一下关于洛夫克萊夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd like to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,生前最后几年的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovecraft's last years …
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是\N{\fnArial\fs30}specifically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1937年3月10日左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that might have gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.15,0:10:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生过什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}around March 10, 1937.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.55,0:10:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在与另一个人合作调查此事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-are you working on this with the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那人穿着风衣 表情超呆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, you know, trenchcoat, looks like Columbo,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话像雨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}talks like rain man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.82,0:10:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是…竞争关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're…competitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,两家敌对的杂志社\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rival magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我当时是这么告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, um, I'll tell you what I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,3月10日 霍华德举办了一场晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard had a dinner party on March 10th.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.08,0:11:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,宴会上请到了多少朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many friends at this party?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, six …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里所谓的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}If by "friends" you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,指的是黑魔法邪教的信徒们\N{\fnArial\fs30}co-worshippers in a black-magic cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当晚齐聚一堂 准备举行一场仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were getting together that night to perform a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,非同小可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "big."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不算什么 不过是开启通往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much. Just open a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一维度的大门而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}into another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would they do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,想见识一下那边的世界 说不定很祥和\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see what's out there … you know, maybe it's friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never friendly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我也是猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.79,0:11:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 咒语起效了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did it work … the spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天的早报并没有提到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, there was no mention of cthulhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.10,0:11:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么灵异事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the morning papers, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我手上刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I do happen to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几封信提到了那场晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}several letters detailing the dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最糟糕的情况也不过是宿醉而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worst thing that was reported was a hangover,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它们放在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it … I've got them right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些细节 其实很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some … it's actually pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…我就放在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, and … and they were…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明就放在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were … they were right th…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.36,0:12:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明放在这里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不可能有隐形人突然现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not like an invisible guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们偷走了 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}could just pop in and steal 'em, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.78,0:12:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, I'll leave you to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到以后打电话通知我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, you call me if you find 'em, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.17,0:12:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你能抽时间过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again for dropping by, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.59,0:12:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫克萊夫特曾试图撬开该死的维度之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovecraft tried to jimmy a damn dimensional door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那结果如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没发生…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing much…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.17,0:12:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但经过我的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except I dug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.19,0:12:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现晚宴上到场的所有来宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every guest invited to the hoedown …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一年之内全部死亡或失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead or disappeared inside a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在准备去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Um, so, where are you off to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.74,0:12:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去和其中一位来宾聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a chat with one of the guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.95,0:12:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你刚不是说到场的都死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, didn't you just say that everyone there died?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫克萊夫特邀请的人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everybody Lovecraft invited died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他的女仆有个九岁的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems the maid had a 9-year-old boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时也在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他现在差不多有83岁了吧 他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he'd be, what, 83 years old now? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从那晚之后 他就没去过别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same place he's been ever since the big night …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直被关在精神病院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked in a mental ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有情况随时通知我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep me posted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's things going there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有莉莎和本的线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lead on Lisa and Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在进行审问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're making a few inquiries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,进展很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.33,0:13:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩的情况怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该能想象得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how you'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一位顾客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.73,0:13:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 酒和咖啡什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, man, y-you're running on, what, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从刚才就一直喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}whiskey and coffee and whatever else you're taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么做不过是绝望之举\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're grasping at straws here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我杀恶魔杀够数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I kill enough of these demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终会有人告诉我克劳力的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eventually one of them's gonna tell me where Crowley is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你审问他们很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, you've been at it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码让我替你一会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you at least let me take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你该歇歇了 - 不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You deserve a break. - No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆 别管闲事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean … - Sam, back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa and Ben …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.87,0:14:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们在哪里 都是我害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever they are, that is 100% on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们出什么事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they are hurt…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要的时候我会喊你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll yell if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.39,0:14:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道本和莉莎的事是不是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, look, I don't know if you're in on this whole Ben/Lisa thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.10,0:14:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你哪怕还有一点良知\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you have any heart whatsoever,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就把他们放回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}bring them back to us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:14:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.52,0:15:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.80,0:15:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我求求你了 你懂不懂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am begging you. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.85,0:15:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来好紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.81,0:15:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓走了本和莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took Ben and Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.87,0:15:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to touch Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.58,0:15:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尊重你的意愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've respected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是钻了个明显的空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm merely exploiting the obvious loophole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要那女人和那孩子在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I have the woman and the boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.93,0:15:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那两个花里胡哨的小英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}your fop-coiffed little heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会掘地三尺地找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be scouring the earth for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不会来找我们的麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, not you and not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一举多得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该先跟我商量的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have talked to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.40,0:15:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可先斩后奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather ask forgiveness than permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不许伤害他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not to harm them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听清了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.74,0:16:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜咋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为那些人类操心得够多的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're maxed out on putting humans out of bounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥爱干啥干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do with them as I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.05,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想阻止哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去把炼狱给我找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find friggin' purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.10,0:16:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,超声波电话响了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call on the bat phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.22,0:16:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,总挑你休息时间找你 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never call during business hours, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 小卡 小卡 你能来真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, Cass, Cass. So good of you to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.67,0:16:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔萨泽 你召唤我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar, why'd you summon me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.31,0:16:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就有话直说了行么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a direct question?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.81,0:16:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟地狱之王在狼狈为奸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in flagrante with the king of hades?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:16:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always were such a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说是真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.14,0:17:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是结束这一切的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a means to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔萨泽 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balthazar, you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.59,0:17:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你说的结束到底指的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the end here, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是洗劫炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, raid purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把灵魂都抓走吗 - 是赢得战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}- snatch up all the souls? - Win the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我只能认为你就是那个皮囊 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can only assume that you'd be the vessel, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些灵魂都吸入你体内 所有的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck up all those souls into yourself, all that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.57,0:17:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你消化不了那么多能量 你会爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or too much juice for you, in which case you explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球也会跟着遭殃\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking a substantial chunk of the planet along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会那样的 - 是啊 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That won't happen. - Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能说这是完全没风险的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just tell me that it's entirely risk-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我之前没告诉你 不过我要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry that I didn't tell you, but I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是站在我这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 你可能挺靠谱 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you may be certifiable, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}In for a penny…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,二不休\N{\fnArial\fs30}in for a pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you hear about this, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小吼猴们说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, your howler monkeys, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.07,0:18:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们对绑架的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, they're just a touch worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都挺火大的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that kidnapping business, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不是跟那个记者一伙的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure you're not with that other reporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个穿风衣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the coat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.21,0:18:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人是骗子 是个冒牌货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liar, that one, not who he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.31,0:18:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一个报社的\N{\fnArial\fs30}affiliated with his paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a couple of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于1937年你参加的那个晚宴聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a dinner party you were at in 1937.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.66,0:19:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都那么着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's so fascinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,都想知道我在伟大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to know about my night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛夫克萊夫特家渡过的那晚到底如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the home of the great H.P. Lovecraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是您愿意说\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都听过那个故事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们念了咒语 他们都说是失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did their spell, and they all said it failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信有怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 你说这种话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you go saying that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会把你终生关在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll lock you in here rest of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.49,0:19:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我 我都信\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell me, and I'll buy it straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那咒语成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spell worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.76,0:19:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开了一扇门 有东西进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A door opened, and something came through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那东西是隐形的 所以大家都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-but it was invisible, so no one knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.75,0:19:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它带走了我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it took my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,占据了她的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.51,0:20:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就变了 甚至闻起来都不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wasn't the same. She even smelled different.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来她就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 奇怪的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, surprise, surprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个接着一个 他们都死掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one by one, they all start dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是第一个说这话的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the first person ever said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.63,0:20:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 想看张照片吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You want to see a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.90,0:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you, pal…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快招了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start talking…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Or I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你活剥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will rip your skin off,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一刀一刀地割\N{\fnArial\fs30}strip by strip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我再杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用同样的方式对待下一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'm gonna do it to the next demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.28,0:21:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你可以闭嘴了 卑鄙的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can stop talking, you miserable sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.05,0:22:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.18,0:22:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, regardless, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.54,0:22:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.24,0:22:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到克劳力会带走莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no idea Crowley would take Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.93,0:22:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.51,0:22:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你嘴里蹦出的任何话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe a word that's coming out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.12,0:22:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过 我们像一家人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said that we were like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得 信任不该是双向的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think that, too. Shouldn't trust run both ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.03,0:22:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你有求我必应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I do everything that you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一召唤 我马上出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always come when you call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你还是不相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, despite your lack of faith in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上你还在威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now your threats…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是 又救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I just saved you, yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你的家人 谁会为你付出这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anyone but your closest kin has ever done more for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.43,0:23:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只求一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask is this one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.71,0:23:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你的炼狱计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust your plan to pop purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 那是我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've earned that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来告诉你 我会去找莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to tell you that I will find Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带他们回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我的后援 先别插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand behind me…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.79,0:23:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我唯一一次求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one time I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是让我坐视不理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking me to stand down?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.57,0:23:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的要求和克劳力的要求是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the same damn ransom note that Crowley handed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.94,0:23:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.35,0:23:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.24,0:23:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是回到克劳力的身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, why don't you go back to Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉他 你俩都去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell him that I said you can both kiss my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.22,0:24:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.95,0:24:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.20,0:24:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉 虽然我们相处的时间不长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we weren't together long, Ellie, but, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.67,0:24:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我知道一点你的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a thing or two about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.76,0:24:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你的安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know your safehouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 这里也不是绝对安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you … this one ain't all that safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是来聊天的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, did you come here just to, um, chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.22,0:25:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃莉 我知道你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.57,0:25:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是从密尔沃基来的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not exactly from Milwaukee, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.87,0:25:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … not that I'd have minded,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你也谎报了年龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you kind of fibbed about your age, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就谎报了一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.79,0:25:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百年\N{\fnArial\fs30}900 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.63,0:25:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你到底搞什么把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, what's your game, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.47,0:25:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.47,0:25:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.47,0:25:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃一出现 立马弄得满城风雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve came through and raised all kinds of hell quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里这么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been here how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.60,0:25:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直没举动是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the slow burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.26,0:25:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不一样啊 - 怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you know, we're not all alike. - Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果叫我怪物可以让你开心点 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, if it makes you feel better to call me that, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.26,0:25:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从炼狱来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're from freakin' purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我上床的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never thought to mention that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.23,0:25:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没想过要告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole time you slept with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.26,0:25:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am what I am, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.08,0:25:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是你的朋友哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I happen to be a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.57,0:25:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要给我个解释吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to explain that to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没让那些白痴打开炼狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't ask those idiots to crack the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.66,0:26:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就碰巧钻了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just happened to be the thing that fell through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.09,0:26:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 出来的是我 算你走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you something … you are lucky it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你和我们是同一阵营的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying you're on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我独自为营 我只是喜欢这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my side. I happen to like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.13,0:26:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想看到这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.36,0:26:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得横尸遍野\N{\fnArial\fs30}turned into some bloody wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.58,0:26:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你杀了洛夫克萊夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you killed H.P. Lovecraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.10,0:26:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他连「你好」都不会写\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. That guy couldn't even write "hello."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.11,0:26:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花了七十五年的时间 紧闭炼狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have spent 75 years trying to keep purgatory closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.73,0:26:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我为什么要给迪恩那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I gave Dean the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了阻止夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stop Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.28,0:26:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该杀了那些该死的龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you guys were supposed to kill the damn dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.43,0:26:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.53,0:26:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都可以归咎到一个天使身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}This all comes down to one angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.07,0:26:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要炼狱 他也在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants purgatory, and he's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.83,0:26:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks for the heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解他 小埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know him, El.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.55,0:26:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会想尽办法达成目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna figure it out one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他的唯一方法就是 先他一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the only way I can stop him is to get ahead of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.62,0:26:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要知道怎么打开炼狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I need to know how you open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.72,0:26:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.17,0:26:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行鲍比 不能告诉任何人 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Bobby. It's too dangerous for anyone to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.23,0:26:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I found you…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.96,0:27:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ain't far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.47,0:27:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少让我带你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least let me take you somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.17,0:27:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.49,0:27:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.69,0:27:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.82,0:27:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有其他的藏身之处 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a couple other places lined up. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.43,0:27:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.02,0:27:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.99,0:27:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己可以保护好我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm better off protecting myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.08,0:27:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 喝酒解愁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinking your feelings, sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.34,0:27:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为那是你哥哥的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was your brother's bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近压力大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stressful times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.39,0:27:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.34,0:27:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.25,0:27:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.69,0:27:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道以后我肯定要后悔 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm gonna live to regret this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.67,0:27:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在正式加入你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm officially on your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.77,0:27:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们凭什么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should believe you why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你不相信我还是有那么点正义感吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe I had a shred of decency?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.18,0:28:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.05,0:28:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么直接 太伤人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.63,0:28:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你说的对 我也是为了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're right. It's survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问过小卡几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I asked Cass some questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.34,0:28:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对他的回答很不满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I disliked his answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.64,0:28:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像疯了一样的相信自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems awfully sure of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.94,0:28:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够吸收那么巨大的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a man who wants to swallow a million nuclear reactors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.27,0:28:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.67,0:28:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有什么好下场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}can get a bit Chernobyl, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, voila.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.99,0:28:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当我是双重间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider me your double agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.16,0:28:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外我擅自去找过你们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I took the liberty of searching for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.72,0:28:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了点时间 克劳力很狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a while … crowley's a clever one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到他们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upside is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但坏消息是也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The downside is, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.50,0:28:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法把他们带出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get them for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么呢 … 因为克劳力满栋楼都画着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? … Because Crowley's angel-proofed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.21,0:28:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使防护阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole bloody building.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.45,0:28:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不信任小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he doesn't trust Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.49,0:28:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎他俩的婚后生活挺顺利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems that marriage is going swimmingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.87,0:28:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 你带我们过去 越近越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, get us as close as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.67,0:28:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之后就靠你们自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then you're on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.24,0:29:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 只能送到这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys, this is where I get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God be with you…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.53,0:29:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,神马的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.28,0:29:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.05,0:31:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dean. Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.18,0:31:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.61,0:31:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.47,0:31:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把小崽子带走 门儿都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brat's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.84,0:31:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也别想带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力就知道你可能会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley thought you might come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.80,0:31:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险起见 他让我附到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he had me jump this hot little piece of ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.77,0:32:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辣妹身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不能没了筹码啊 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't go losing our leverage, now, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再靠近一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Another step…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.93,0:32:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的阑尾切除手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Free appendectomy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.38,0:32:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈现在意识很清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she's awake in here … your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.45,0:32:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听到她的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can hear her thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 别听她的 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't listen to her, ben. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.69,0:32:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是想告诉他 你是他真正的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just gonna tell him that you're his real daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.53,0:32:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.93,0:32:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道你父亲是谁 小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows who your real dad is, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.95,0:32:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈是个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's a slut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.87,0:32:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丫的给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.81,0:32:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 现在想英雄救美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what? You're her white knight now?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.85,0:32:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她后悔认识了你 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wishes she never met you, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.39,0:32:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识你是她这辈子最大的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the worst mistake she ever made!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.90,0:32:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,算第二吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, second worst…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.71,0:32:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从有了你之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After keeping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.90,0:32:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 那不是你妈 她在说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not your mom, ben. She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个从小缺乏父爱的有什么资格说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says the c-minus lay with 10 miles of daddy issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.01,0:32:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每天晚上都是怎么过的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever gets you through the night, tiny tim.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别过来 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah-ah-ah. Back off, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.54,0:32:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 她在求我杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she's begging me to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.43,0:32:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈说是你拖她后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says you hold her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.00,0:32:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你生下来之后 她从来没快活过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had a lick of fun since you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 看着我 看我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, look at me. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.37,0:33:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.06,0:33:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.74,0:33:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了迪恩 打我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, dean? Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.46,0:33:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不想伤害到莉莎啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't want to hurt poor Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.87,0:33:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.14,0:33:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.48,0:33:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.08,0:33:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.99,0:33:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.14,0:33:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.74,0:33:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.92,0:33:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告你 … 滚回地狱去 你这个黑眼婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm warning you. … You can go to hell, you black-eyed bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.72,0:33:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.63,0:33:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续驱逐我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exorcise me now…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.72,0:34:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在不过是具行尸走肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just a dead meatsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.88,0:34:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what was it you wanted to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.06,0:34:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.59,0:34:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.94,0:34:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.91,0:34:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 - 莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.63,0:34:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.84,0:34:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,用力摁住 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, put pressure on that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.48,0:34:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很疼 宝贝 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, honey. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.21,0:34:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, it's all right, it's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.61,0:34:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨姆 有事请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam. Leave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.79,0:34:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 你死哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, where are you, damn it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 我们得把她弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ben. We got to get her out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.19,0:34:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.38,0:34:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 小伙子 你得振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, man, I need you to pull it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.01,0:34:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强些 你母亲现在正需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be strong. Your mom needs you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.03,0:34:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,到行李袋里拿上盐弹枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go over in that duffel bag. Grab the salt gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.45,0:34:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得抱你妈妈出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to carry your mom out,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.48,0:34:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有东西要袭击我们 你就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if anything comes at us, you shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.37,0:34:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是 - 现在就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But … - Go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.32,0:35:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 刀 带上刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Get the knife. Get the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.87,0:35:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 本 手肘夹紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Ben. Keep your elbow in,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.19,0:35:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪抵肩膀 听我指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}gun tight to your shoulder, and watch for the kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.21,0:35:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben! - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.30,0:35:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 振作点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.24,0:35:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想救你妈妈了吗 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your mom to die?! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.52,0:35:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.23,0:35:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean! - Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.53,0:35:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.01,0:35:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 我们得去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We got to get to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.42,0:35:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 把枪给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben. Give the gun to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.27,0:35:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 开辆车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we need a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.46,0:36:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.00,0:36:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事 本 她没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine, Ben. She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.25,0:36:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事的 马上就到医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be just fine. We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.79,0:36:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别睡 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey. Hey. Stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.81,0:36:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 再开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you got to go faster, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.54,0:36:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 你会好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be fine. You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.81,0:36:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,本 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.93,0:36:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.05,0:36:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.27,0:36:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.05,0:36:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想听我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.69,0:37:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她根本撑不过今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be dead by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.66,0:37:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.54,0:37:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.50,0:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么都没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too little, too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.28,0:37:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.04,0:37:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我也不是为你而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, regardless, I didn't come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.64,0:37:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.38,0:37:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.90,0:37:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll wake soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.90,0:37:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我是真心诚意的向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I said I'm sorry, and I meant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.02,0:37:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.33,0:37:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望覆水能收\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish this changed anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.21,0:37:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.46,0:38:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.34,0:38:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我只想尽力弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}All else aside, I just wanted to fix what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.81,0:38:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事你能帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one more thing you could do for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.78,0:38:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.37,0:38:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.24,0:38:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.84,0:38:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我们出车祸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - We were in a car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.25,0:38:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 是的是的 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah, yeah. I'm … I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.09,0:38:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头部撞得挺重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit your head pretty bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.08,0:38:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你现在没事啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.72,0:38:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.59,0:38:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 叫迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.00,0:39:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我撞了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… I'm the guy who hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.59,0:39:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.83,0:39:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时有点失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost control for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.97,0:39:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是想来说声抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just wanted to say that I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.78,0:39:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你们两位都没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm real happy you two are both okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.77,0:39:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.19,0:39:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也 很高兴你们的生活又能恢复从前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm just … I'm glad your life can get back to normal now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're okay, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才重要 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that's what's important, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.81,0:39:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.60,0:39:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.98,0:39:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you two alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.40,0:39:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好照顾你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care of your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.88,0:40:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.38,0:40:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.93,0:40:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你以前是干过不少蠢事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know, you have pulled some shady crap before,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.52,0:40:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这绝对是最烂的一遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this has got to be the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.41,0:40:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩盖他们的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whitewashing their memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个过来人 我劝你一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it from somebody who knows …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.34,0:40:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你再跟我提莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ever mention Lisa or Ben to me again,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.27,0:40:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就打断你的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will break your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.63,0:40:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 … 我没在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean … i'm not kidding.
